{
  "_about": "The DFL playbook for the chalkboard view (site/playcalls.js). It is a reference table the page reads: how teams line up and what each of the 22 players is told to do on a call, how likely each call is in each situation, and how each coordinator's temperament tilts those chances. Edit the numbers and the page follows. Nothing here changes a game: the engine decides every result first, and the page then picks the most likely call that fits what happened. Coordinates are yards: u downfield from the line of scrimmage (negative is behind it), v across the field (0 to 53.3, the middle is 26.65). A path is a list of [u, v] points; 'rel' says what they are measured from: 'abs' the field, 'start' the player's own starting spot (v positive towards higher v), 'in' the player's starting spot with v positive towards the middle of the field. A mirrored play (flip) swaps left and right. A call with 'only' is used only when one of those tags is on.",
  "version": 1,
  "tags": {
    "_about": "Situation tags the page works out for each play. A call's 'fit' lists a multiplier for each tag that is on (1 when a tag is not listed). The tags: first, second, third, fourth (the down); short (3 yards or less to go), medium (4 to 7), long (8 or more); backed_up (own 10 or worse), redzone (inside the opponent's 20), goal (inside the 5); trailing, leading (the offense's side of the score); late (fourth quarter with 5 minutes or less, or the last 2 minutes of the second); trailing_late, leading_late (both); blowout (ahead by 17 or more in the second half); trailing_big (behind by 17 or more in the second half); no_timeouts (the offense has none left); try (a two-point try)."
  },
  "temperament": {
    "_about": "How a coordinator's archetype tilts the choice of call. Each call has a 'style' (aggressive, safe, trick, neutral); a multiplier here multiplies the chance of every call of that style. 'sharp' is how hard the situation weighs for a coordinator (1 is normal; above 1 the situation fit counts for more, below 1 for less).",
    "Gambler": {"aggressive": 1.7, "safe": 0.7, "trick": 1.3, "sharp": 0.9},
    "Innovator": {"aggressive": 1.2, "safe": 0.85, "trick": 1.9, "sharp": 1.0},
    "Disciplinarian": {"aggressive": 0.85, "safe": 1.3, "trick": 0.6, "sharp": 1.1},
    "Steady Hand": {"aggressive": 0.8, "safe": 1.3, "trick": 0.6, "sharp": 1.0},
    "Survivor": {"aggressive": 0.85, "safe": 1.2, "trick": 0.8, "sharp": 1.0},
    "Tactician": {"aggressive": 1.0, "safe": 1.0, "trick": 1.0, "sharp": 1.4},
    "Developer": {"aggressive": 1.0, "safe": 1.05, "trick": 0.9, "sharp": 1.0},
    "Players' Coach": {"aggressive": 1.05, "safe": 1.0, "trick": 1.0, "sharp": 0.85}
  },
